## (b) forced reuse inside one clock tick (adversarial for starttime)
# getconf CLK_TCK = 100, so starttime has 10 ms granularity. Two
# processes created in the same tick at the same pid share BOTH pid and
# starttime, which falsifies (pid,starttime) as a unique key.
